WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A big, fluffy rabbit wakes up in his burrow.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
He steps outside into a bright, sunlit forest.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Butterflies and birds drift lazily through the trees.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.000
Three troublemaking rodents are watching from a branch.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.000
They plot their next prank on anyone who passes by.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.000
[gentle orchestral music playing]
